   PGM

   /*************************************************/
   /** THIS PROGRAM PROCESSES CCS DATA: TRANSFER,  **/
   /**   REPORT AND CLEAR.                         **/
   /** AKRON RESEARCH (118) ONLY.                  **/
   /** CHANGE THE MCPRT PRTF TO DIRECT REPORT.     **/
   /*************************************************/

             OVRPRTF    FILE(MCPRT) TOFILE(*LIBL/MCPRT39)
             DLTF       FILE(QTEMP/CCSDATA)
             MONMSG     MSGID(CPF0000)
             CRTPF      FILE(QTEMP/CCSDATA) RCDLEN(43)
             OVRDBF     FILE(CCSDATA) TOFILE(QTEMP/CCSDATA)

             CALL       TCCSPROC

             DLTF       FILE(QTEMP/CCSDATA)
             MONMSG     MSGID(CPF0000)

    ENDPGM
